msgstr "Salita/Riconsegna"

#: admin/docs/WBTM_Docs_Content.php:546
#: admin/settings/WBTM_Settings_Pickup_Point.php:91
msgid "On/Off Pickup Point"
msgstr "Punto di prelievo attivato/disattivato"

#: admin/docs/WBTM_Docs_Content.php:546
msgid ""
"Lets customers choose a precise pickup point instead of just the main "
