msgstr "Modulo fiscale e di registrazione"

#: admin/docs/WBTM_Docs_Content.php:558
#: admin/settings-modern/WBTM_Settings_Modern.php:132
#: admin/WBTM_Settings.php:54
msgid "Tax Configure"
msgstr "Configurazione fiscale"

#: admin/docs/WBTM_Docs_Content.php:558
msgid ""
"Applies your WooCommerce tax rules to this bus. If tax is not enabled in "
"WooCommerce a warning panel links you straight to the right settings screen."
msgstr ""
